Minecraft

The axolotl - the shape and sizes of its head, body, gills, legs and fins, and
its Lucy texture, whose texel colors color every face - is from Minecraft, by
Mojang Studios (https://minecraft.wiki/w/Axolotl). The reference files in
notes/mojang/ (axolotl.geo.json and axolotl_lucy.png) are from Mojang's
bedrock-samples repository (https://github.com/Mojang/bedrock-samples) and remain
Mojang's, under that repository's terms. They are excluded from the license
above. This pack is not affiliated with, authorized, maintained, or endorsed by
Mojang Studios or Microsoft. Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang Studios.

Jagex assets

Zebak's skeletons and animations - in export/, source/*.glb and bundle.dat -
and his own models in export/ are taken from the Old School RuneScape game cache
and are excluded from the license above.

This is not affiliated with, authorized, maintained, or endorsed by Jagex. Old
School RuneScape and all associated visual assets, trademarks, and copyrights
are the sole property of Jagex.
